                                  "blocks": [
                                    {
                                      "type": "note",
                                      "title": "What the boot override does",
                                      "lines": [
                                        "The override applies to the next boot only, unless Persistent is ticked, in which case it applies to every boot until it is set back to \"No override\".",
                                        "Setting it does not restart anything by itself - pair it with a power action above.",
                                        "The identify LED blinks on the chassis front panel, for finding the right box in a rack."
