                      "blocks": [
                        {
                          "type": "note",
                          "title": "What this list is",
                          "lines": [
                            "Every reading the last sweep found outside its thresholds, across every machine that is switched on for sweeping, worst first. It is built from what the sweep already collected, so opening this tab asks nothing of any BMC.",
                            "A machine contributes at most a dozen rows. If one is having a genuinely bad day, open its card on the Fleet tab for the full sensor table.",
                            "How fresh these are is the sensor cadence under Module settings, not the sweep interval - sensors are re-read less often than power because they move more slowly."
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
